    "body": "@joemcgill right now, the intent is that `auto` would be returned by the \"[parse a sizes attribute](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#parsing-a-sizes-attribute)\" algorithm, and evaluate to 100vw. But I can see that falling back to the next value can be useful. I'll file a new issue.",
